STM32 Demo PCB

A compact STM32-based development and demonstration PCB designed for learning embedded systems, PCB design, and STM32 peripheral interfacing.
This board includes USB communication, SWD debugging, UART, I2C headers, crystal oscillator, and onboard 3.3V power regulation.
Features:-
STM32F103C8T6 MCU
USB Type-C Interface
SWD Debug Header
UART Header
I2C Header
3.3V Power Supply
8MHz Crystal Oscillator
2-Layer PCB Design
Tools Used:-
KiCad

Applications:-
STM32 Learning
Embedded Projects
Sensor Interfacing
Communication Testing
PCB Design Practice
PCB Highlights
Clean component placement
USB communication support
Decoupling capacitors near MCU
Compact routing
Separate debugging headers


Future Improvements :-
